              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omosomba ogokora emeremo n’obong’aini nigo agwancherwa n’omorwoti, korende endamwamu y’omorwoti nigo ekoba igoro ase oria okomorentera obosooku.",
          "type": "text",
